{#- Everything is deferred. The six consumer scripts used to be render-blocking
    classic tags — 100 KB in the critical path of every URL for nothing, since
    each one already waits for DOMContentLoaded, which deferred scripts are
    guaranteed to precede. `defer` also preserves document order, so the
    vendors still execute before their consumers.

    The motion stack is skipped on pages that carry no motion (`motion: false`
    in front matter — the legal pages). The head bootstrap already strips
    .js-reveal/.js-arrival on load when nothing claims them, so those pages
    degrade to plain readable documents by the same path a blocked script
    would take.

    The hand-written ?v= query strings are gone: scripts/fingerprint.mjs
    rewrites every src below to a content-hashed filename, which is a strictly
    better cache key and needs no human to remember to bump it. -#}
{%- if motion !== false %}
  <script src="/js/vendor/gsap.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/vendor/ScrollTrigger.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/vendor/SplitText.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/vendor/lenis.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/stage.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/arrival.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/daylight.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/cursor.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/ambient.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/fx.js" defer></script>
{%- endif %}
{#- The fitter ships outside the motion gate on purpose: fitting is
    measurement, not animation. A legal page with `motion: false` still wants
    its headline set to the measure, and the module resolves to its solved
    width with no transition, so it is already in its reduced-motion state.
    It loads before i18n.js so its mk:i18n listener is registered first. -#}
  <script src="/js/fitter.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/i18n.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/accordion.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/animations.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/header.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/ai-concierge.js" defer></script>
{#- Meta Pixel (decisión D3, 2026-08-18). Fuera de la puerta de motion: la
    medición no es animación. El ID vive en js/meta-pixel.js. -#}
  <script src="/js/meta-pixel.js" defer></script>
